Apple's first 27.3 betas bring expanded <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/siri/">Siri</a> AI actions, a redesigned Health app, and new Fitness+ features, alongside conversation summaries on the Apple Watch. This week's episode of <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/ios-27-3-betas-huge-features-siri-ai-health-fitness-and-more/id1602394741?i=1000800252162">The MacRumors Show</a> takes a closer look at the updates.<br/>
<br/>
