&zwnj;Siri&zwnj; AI gains <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/03/ios-27-3-siri-ai/">additional actions</a> across Apple's apps, including unsubscribing from mailing lists, organizing files, and managing Safari tabs. In Weather, &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; can add saved locations and toggle severe weather or next-hour precipitation notifications. The additions extend the assistant's usefulness for everyday tasks, although the full range of supported requests can still be difficult to discover.<br/>
<br/>
A new <a href="https://developer.apple.com/news/?id=gdk2umrf">developer preview</a> also enables more flexible third-party integrations. Developers can supply custom actions and skills that help &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; coordinate multiple steps, improving its handling of more complicated requests. <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/app-store/">App Store</a> submissions for these integrations are scheduled to open in the spring.<br/>
<br/>
Safari adds <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/03/ios-27-3-safari/">vertical tabs and Adaptive Dark Mode</a>, allowing websites without their own dark appearance to adopt one automatically. The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-duo/">iPhone Duo</a> also gains horizontal Reachability and a revised keyboard, making its wider outer display easier to operate with one hand.<br/>
<br/>
Apple Fitness+ gains <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/03/apple-fitness-plus-gym-strength/">Gym Strength</a>, which creates personalized four-week plans based on available equipment and workout preferences. Short videos from Fitness+ trainers demonstrate proper form, extending the service beyond workouts that require following an entire video session. The initial beta's equipment selection and scheduling options nevertheless leave room for improvement, particularly for users whose routines vary from week to week.<br/>
<br/>
The <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/03/ios-27-3-health-app/">redesigned Health app</a> returns with Insights and Longevity sections, turning collected measurements into more accessible guidance and longer-term health assessments. iPhone  Duo-style StandBy mode displays bring more customizable clocks, Calendar views, and Weather information to additional iPhones. <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/apple-music/">Apple Music</a> also gains enhanced transitions, concert recommendations, and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/03/apple-music-selfie-sing/">Selfie Sing</a> karaoke videos.<br/>
<br/>
On the Apple Watch, <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/11/03/watchos-27-3-audio-intelligence/">Live Rewind and Siri Recap</a> introduce new ways to recover and summarize spoken information. Live Rewind provides a transcription of the preceding 15 seconds, while &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; Recap creates detailed conversation summaries that can be useful for meeting notes. Time- and location-based scheduling provides more control over when &zwnj;Siri&zwnj; Recap operates.<br/>
